description:
The LeskhozInvest company is the general dealer of woodworking production located in Verkhnyaya Tura, Sverdlovsk region.
The production is equipped with the latest technology from the worldʹs leading manufacturers and produces:
• large-sized birch plywood non overlaid;
• film faced plywood;
• kiln-dried (KD) softwood and hardwood timber;
• softwood and hardwood timber of natural moisture.

